{"id":"n27368-1-16","stage":1,"title":"아침 · 早上","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27368-1-16-1","ko":"아침에 일찍 일어나기가 너무 힘들어.","zh":"早上太难早起了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침에","audio":"/audio/930cc492b37cd832fc24.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿。","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}},{"text":"일어나기가","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어나기가","audio":"/audio/a4e0f67f87395d707ad3.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어","audio":"/audio/42a96966a9378057f47c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb6bc0d430695d74a2ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27368-1-16-2","ko":"그럼 내가 아침 일곱 시쯤 전화로 깨워 줄까?","zh":"那我早上七点左右打电话叫你起床，好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}},{"text":"일곱","meaning":"七","explanation":"일곱：七。","readings":[{"term":"일곱","audio":"/audio/3036db5d69be8f4dece4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70778","senseId":"1","lemma":"일곱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"te